<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00239> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "A via Merulana, sicché... Nel diciassette, dopo du anni de fidanzamento a momenti, questi me sa che nun la pianteno, me so detto tra me."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 104"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00242> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "palazzo del ducentodicinnove"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Tutto un po’ li aveva indotti a rimanere dov’erano: in quel maledetto palazzo del ducentodicinnove."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 105"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00243> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "Prati"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Chiunque artro, ar posto loro, avrebbe cercato de mejo. Ora lo capiva: troppo tardi! Un ber quartierino in Prati, un villino a lungotevere... Sospirò."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 105"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00244> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "villino a lungotevere"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Chiunque artro, ar posto loro, avrebbe cercato de mejo. Ora lo capiva: troppo tardi! Un ber quartierino in Prati, un villino a lungotevere... Sospirò."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 105"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00245> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Valdarena e Balducci, cugino e marito vennero posti a confronto: il diciannove mattina, ch’era sabato: Balducci era andato a dormire al D’Azeglio."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 105"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00246> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "«Chi è?» Don Lorenzo Corpi chiedeva di essere ascoltato per comunicazioni urgenti, «riguardanti il doloroso caso di via Merulana»."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 106"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00248> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Du scarpe nere nere lustre lustre, lunghe e forti, bone da camminà su l’Aventino, oltrecché sul Celio, a sòla doppia."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 106"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00249> a chora:PlaceReference ;
