<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00434> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Piovuto dai colli saluberrimi, il superbrigadiere-centauro aveva interpretato il desiderio di tutti"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 176"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00437> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Ingravallo maturò de premura quelle che il Truce in cattedra, a palazzo der Mappamonno, avrebbe chiamato le direttive da impartire... alle sottostanti gerarchie."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 177"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00438> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "carabinieri di Marino"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Tutto il merito, ora, ai carabinieri di Marino. « Sti lanternoni d’ ’o tteate ’e Pulcinella. »"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 177"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00441> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "che fungeva pure da maestro de cerimonie, a Santo Stefano, l’opportunità richiedendo"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 178"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00452> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "li Du Santi"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "E tutti ’o dicevano, a li Du Santi."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 180"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00454> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Si differiva passo passo da un quartiere all’altro: monticiano a le dieci, trasteverino a le quattro, a Piazza Colonna o a l’Esedra con le luci e i rossoverdi richiami della sera."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 182"^^xsd:string .

