<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00459> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "« Batteva puro via Veneto, via Ludovisi, ogni tanto, ch’è ’n po’ più scura, pe’ via de le donne. »"@it ;
