<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00471> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Vice-commissario ai Frari, i cinque cherubini scarlatti d’una delle sei madonne in trono di Giovan Bellino (Accademia) gli si erano stampati nella memoria."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 191"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00472> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Ingravallo, poi, aveva letto Norman Douglas oltre che Lawrence: e ne aveva stillato Calabria, Sardegna (ringhiando) come da fiale d’un iperofficiante elisire."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 192"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00473> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Ingravallo, poi, aveva letto Norman Douglas oltre che Lawrence: e ne aveva stillato Calabria, Sardegna (ringhiando) come da fiale d’un iperofficiante elisire."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 192"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00474> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Aveva dunque triangolato, in sua geodesia, anche il territorio circèo, cavandone documentata certezza che la Circe non si fosse piazzata poi tanto male a esercitare l’arte sua."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 192"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00475> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "Reggio (Calabria)"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Lui, Norman Douglas, o lui, Lawrence, li riconosceva emergere dalle tre città di Reggio (Calabria), Sassari e Civitavecchia, con gran dispetto dei palermitani."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 192"^^xsd:string .

