<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00493> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "« O magari a la Vite, si tanto tanto ce la fa a capì... ch’è una de fora, e che viè pure da lontano, e de razza scerta. »"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 200"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00494> a chora:PlaceReference ;
