<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00716> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "« E va buò, » disse Ingravallo, a cui quella toponomastica aveva procurato du strizzatine de mascelle: « a Tor di Gheppio, ora. »"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 298"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00721> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "La notizia orribile, forse, non era pervenuta a Tor di Gheppio se non troppo tardi, e in quella solitudine... il terrore aveva paralizzato una donnàcola."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 302"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00722> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "o t’ ’o farà sputare ’o brigadiere, in caserma, a Marino: ’o brigadiere Pestalozzi"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 306"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qpl> a chora:Witness ;
