<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00040> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "casermone color pidocchio"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Davanti al casermone color pidocchio, una folla: circonfusa d’una rete protettiva di biciclette."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_I> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 26"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00274> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Nella scrivania piccola vicino ar balcone, a via Nicotera, il maresciallo Di Pietrantonio, coadiuvato dall’agente scelto Paolillo, ritrovò diecimila lire: in dieci fogli da mille novi novi."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IV> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 119"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00299> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "e due terne antagoniste: l’Elodia, la Enea Cucco, la Giulietta Frisoni (scala B), da una parte, e da quell’artra la Cammarota, la Bottafavi e l’Alda Pernetti (scala A)"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_V> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 139"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00300> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "e due terne antagoniste: l’Elodia, la Enea Cucco, la Giulietta Frisoni (scala B), da una parte, e da quell’artra la Cammarota, la Bottafavi e l’Alda Pernetti (scala A)"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_V> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 139"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00317> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Don Ciccio, una vorta a San Lorenzo, s'intrufolò co l'orecchie appizzate ne la folla ch'entrava in chiesa, e li segugi sua fecero artrettanto"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_V> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 141"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00378> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "accusata e accusatrice carrozzate infine a Santo Stefano, e la scarpara puro insieme a loro."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VI> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 159"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00435> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Nel frattempo, salito a palazzo Simonetti a via Lanza, Ingravallo maturò de premura quelle che il Truce in cattedra avrebbe chiamato le direttive da impartire."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 177"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00550> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Lo interrompeva un tabernacolo alto, a due pioventi, con arricciolature di stucchi pallidi in fronte."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VIII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 216"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00553> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "edicola delli Du Santi"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Nella edicola delli Du Santi rifiorita e riccioluta di stucchi in un pallore di ricotta, gli venne finalmente fatto di radunare e adibire ad opera i titoli"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VIII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 219"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00554> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "il cortovestito giovane, traversata la via, s’era portato sotto l’edicola come per una prece o per un voto"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VIII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 219"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00558> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "bottega"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Vo a chiamalle, si me guardate la bottega: de voi me fido"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VIII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 222"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00572> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "ponte del Divino Amore"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Ar ponte del Divino Amore! è na parola! due chilometri emmezzo e pure più: quaranta minuti di cammino: e con la ragazza, e co quele scarpe che ciaveva."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 238"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00573> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "La strada era una sola, pe fortuna, salvo il primo pezzo però: la statale, l'Appia, poi ad angolo retto la deviazione della provinciale, pe Falcognana."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 238"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00574> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "La strada era una sola, pe fortuna, salvo il primo pezzo però: la statale, l'Appia, poi ad angolo retto la deviazione della provinciale, pe Falcognana."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 238"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00575> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "La strada era una sola, pe fortuna, salvo il primo pezzo però: la statale, l'Appia, poi ad angolo retto la deviazione della provinciale, pe Falcognana."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 238"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00592> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "i carabinieri si avanzarono tacendo sulla banchina con passi gravi e chiodati fino alla porta del casello."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 242"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00599> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "La tracagnotta, quasi che il brigadiere le avesse puntato una pistola sulla faccia, si scosse, giravoltò, camminò via da parere la sonnambula, entrò in casa, o casello invece che fosse."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 249"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00600> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "salirono, per gradini di peperino grigio, al piano sopra, in una stanza più piccola, irregolare, quanto comportava la testata della scala."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 249"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00621> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "dopo averla così tradita e spregiata, a lei, povera (e il pianto, quasi, era dolce), p'annà fino ar casello de Casal Bruciato a mette l'ori da la stronza."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 269"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00660> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Aveva ordine di accompagnarlo in questura, le notificò in breve il Biondone, ed esibì una seconda volta la carta"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 284"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00667> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Uscirono da la confusione verso via Mamiani o via Ricasoli: c'era un passaggio tra le bancarelle de li pesciaroli e de li pollaroli."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 285"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00668> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Uscirono da la confusione verso via Mamiani o via Ricasoli: c'era un passaggio tra le bancarelle de li pesciaroli e de li pollaroli."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 285"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00674> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "A via Giovanni Lanza, in riparazione, tangheggiò e rollò ne le pozze pe più de cento metri."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 292"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00675> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "A largo Brancaccio, mentre che staveno svortando in via Merulana verso piazza San Giovanni, Ingravallo si volse, cupo, alla sua sinistra."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 292"^^xsd:string .

