<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00036> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "civico ducentodicinnove"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Saliti sul PV e discesi appunto al Viminale, presero il tram di San Giovanni. Sicché in una ventina di minuti raggiunsero il civico ducentodicinnove."@it ;
    chora:hasVariant <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00727> ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_I> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 25"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00038> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "palazzo dell’Oro"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Il palazzo dell’Oro, o dei pescicani che fusse, era là: cinque piani, più il mezzanino. Intignazzato e grigio."@it ;
    chora:hasVariant <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00727> ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_I> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 25"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00099> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "oppure via Manuela – Orestino Bozzi – sora Elodia – Enea Cucco (scala B)"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_I> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 49"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00144> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "Faiti"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Er sangue aveva impiastrato tutto er collo, er davanti de la camicetta, una manica: la mano: una spaventevole colatura d’un rosso nero, da Faiti o da Cengio (don Ciccio rammemorò subito, con un lontano pianto nell’anima, povera mamma!)."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_II> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 61"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00145> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Er sangue aveva impiastrato tutto er collo, er davanti de la camicetta, una manica: la mano: una spaventevole colatura d’un rosso nero, da Faiti o da Cengio (don Ciccio rammemorò subito, con un lontano pianto nell’anima, povera mamma!)."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_II> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 61"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00514> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Nel laboratorio bettola delli Du Santi, tutte le ragazze, ogni volta, e anche la Zamira d’altronde, s’erano smarrite in una trasognata innocenza."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VIII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 208"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00534> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Tantoché al passaggio a livello di Casal Bruciato il vetrone girasole... per fil a dest!"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VIII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 212"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00568> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "« Quale passaggio? » « Pe la strada de Castel de Leva, fino ar ponte: poi, a sinistra, fino ar passaggio a livello de Casal Bruciato. »"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VIII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 237"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00585> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Dalla strada di Falcognana, che sorpassa col ponte del Divino Amore la mezza trincera della ferrovia qualche centinaio di metri più giù, si disgiungeva in quel punto la vicinale per Casal Bruciato."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 240"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00614> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Non commentò quel che gli lasciarono intendere. Era già sul punto di risalire a Casal Bruciato."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 262"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00616> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "La ragazza, si sarebbe detto una mùtola, ora, non meno della nonna, fu condotta al bivio: dove sostava, ad attendere i carabinieri di ritorno, il calesse."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 263"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00632> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Posando invece anche un momento solo al casello, Iginio poteva poi raggiungere Casal Bruciato, superare o no l'ardeatina, svignarsela non veduto sotto gli spalti d'arenaria che fanno la sicurezza invisibile di Ardea."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 274"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00641> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:attestedForm "anziate"@it ;
    chora:excerpt "Così almanaccando s'avvide alfine della strada: erano quasi all'anziate."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_IX> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 274"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00687> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "a culo indietro e in curva stretta e in salita, da inagugliarsi poi nel toboga del Dazzélio a marcia avanti, occorsero più caràche, in senso inverso ai descritti."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 296"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00688> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Discesero ai Torraccio, dove la sciroccata spegnendosi intepidiva: o ppareva."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 297"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00689> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Svoltarono sull’Appia a li Due Santi, da doverla percorrere un buon chilometro a ritroso, cioè verso Roma, fino alla deviazione per Falcognana."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 297"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00690> a chora:PlaceReference ;
