<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00098> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "via Manuela – Menegazzi – Bottafavi – Pernetti Alda e fratello (scala A)"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_I> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 49"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00706> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Quanto ar ritorno, poi, si è che lei, dopo Tor der Gheppio, avete d’annà puro a la Pavona, alora potressimo scegne fino a Casal Bruciato: a imboccà l’ardeatina, appunto."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 298"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00715> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWitness <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/witness/qp> ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio> ;
    chora:excerpt "Là, si lei volete, s’incrocia su la strada de la Solforata e de Pratica de Mare: sicché, p’er Palazzo, potemo venì su diritti fino a la Pavona che in tutto, da Casal Bruciato, saranno sei chilometri o sette, a dì tanto."@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_X> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 298"^^xsd:string .

